# Build-time (Vite) variables for production builds, including Workers Builds.
#
# This file is committed ON PURPOSE and must hold PUBLIC values only.
#
# No VITE_* variable is required: the SPA and the Worker share one origin
# (ADR-001), and accounts are created by invitation, not public signup
# (ADR-0013). If a build-time variable is added later, document why it is public
# and keep every secret in the Worker (`wrangler secret put`).
